WEBVTT

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:32.080
Age...

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:48.340
You're not allowed to attack the
ones who are on that ship, Rom Ror.

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:59.810
<b>Over and over again I wish on the dazzling star far away</b>

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:06.030
<b>Wandering heartbeats, gravitation, the story of their attraction</b>

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:26.260
<b>When did it begin? No one knows the end of it</b>

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:33.260
<b>It's not a trick or an illusion, it's a current that I can't swim against</b>

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:35.270
<b>(Dark!)</b>

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:40.270
<b>The monster that lives in the darkness</b>

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:42.110
<b>(Blight!)</b>

00:01:42.190 --> 00:01:45.730
<b>As if I were easily getting swallowed into it</b>

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:47.360
<b>(I seek a hero!)</b>

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:49.990
<b>I awake as I truly am</b>

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:58.830
<b>If God says conflicts and life's old dreams go hand in hand</b>

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:04.090
<b>I'm looking for you even if it means ripping my body apart</b>

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:07.460
<b>With a flower held to my heart,</b>

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:12.720
<b>no one can stop this heartbeat now that it's begun</b>

00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:16.810
<b>We're destined to come in contact</b>

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:35.410
He really came... just like he promised.

00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:36.450
Age...

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:39.750
Have we been able to contact the Argonaut?

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:41.710
We still can't reach them.

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:46.460
Keep on trying. Let's head to the Argonaut's
landing location with the Organ units

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:29.500
Age.

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:47.810
What have you done to Yuty, Rom Ror?!
Why do you shut off your thoughts from me?

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:49.860
That's how we connect

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:57.820
That's right, I'm right here, Yuty.

00:03:57.910 --> 00:04:01.040
I've been searching for the Tribe of Gold
for the sakes of my tribe and the universe,

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:07.500
believing that they
must still remain somewhere.

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:13.170
And I'll finally be released from
the agony of keeping on hoping for it.

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:18.510
You should be delighted, Phaetho O.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:44.080
Age said he was going to rescue Yuty.

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:48.460
If all five of us fight at the same time,
it'll definitely mean madness.

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:53.880
But I do understand
what Lernaea is wishing for.

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:58.550
To avoid madness,
yet still give everything we've got.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:04.390
That's what Artemia is wishing for also.
Artemia wants to stop this more than I do.

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:08.810
Maybe we should've had more faith in them...

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:12.440
...the Heroes within us...

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:20.240
Age said that the Nodos were born
to give the Tribe of Heroes hearts.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:27.910
If that's the case, when we trust the
Tribe of Heroes, they will surely trust us, too.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:31.920
With their own hearts, which we created.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.710
That's what Age does.

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:39.430
Let's go. And believe that we
have the power to overcome madness.

00:05:39.510 --> 00:05:43.850
This is our last agreement.

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:58.130
Four Nodos are fighting together...

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:02.260
...in order to protect this planet.

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:06.720
Age must have kept fighting for this moment...

00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:10.350
What is it?

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:13.960
Artemia has gone mad...

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:21.840
Mehitak!

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:47.780
A Hedron shield! One different
from the power that we know of?

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:05.380
Unbelievable fluctuation...
Is that Artemia's true power?

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:08.340
What is that?

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:20.020
The planet is resonating
with Kervius' power? No...

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:28.990
Lernaea's power? Is it
projecting all our powers?

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:34.200
Age told us what each of us represents...

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:38.750
Light. Life. Time.

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:44.590
Belcross is existence. And Kervius is...

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:18.710
If Kervius is nothingness,

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:24.380
why isn't this planet projecting
that power and self-destructing?

00:10:24.460 --> 00:10:27.710
If Kervius's power is nothingness,

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:31.340
why were we able
to get out of the nothingness?

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:35.890
If the Tribe of Heroes'
madness is mere destruction,

00:10:35.970 --> 00:10:40.390
then why did the Tribe of Gold
leave them with the Nodos?

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:43.650
If Kervius is nothingness,
why give it a heart?

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:48.570
This planet is projecting Erymanthos' power?

00:10:48.650 --> 00:10:51.320
If Artemia is light...

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:53.910
If Lernaea is life...

00:10:53.990 --> 00:10:56.740
If Erymanthos is time...

00:10:56.830 --> 00:11:00.290
If Belcross is existence...

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:03.080
The past that would've been possible...

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:09.710
All the possible questions for me to have
ever asked are coming together in the present.

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:17.810
If Erymanthos could really go back in time
and space, why couldn't it destroy Belcross?

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:24.480
If the power of the Tribe of Gold really
exists on Elysium, how do we discover it?

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:32.990
The loss from that time...

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:40.620
My energy... Erymanthos' energy from
20,000 jumps will gather in one place.

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:46.580
All the energy will flow into
whichever one of us gives up first.

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:52.470
Just like Lernaea's underlying
power is the regeneration,

00:11:52.550 --> 00:11:56.800
and Artemia's underlying
power is that fluctuation,

00:11:56.890 --> 00:12:00.470
that must be Erymanthos' underlying...

00:12:50.650 --> 00:12:52.570
Jump, Erymanthos!

00:13:25.430 --> 00:13:29.900
This is probably nothing but another
past that needs to be collected.

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:14.110
If my thinking is correct,
Belcross is the very instrument

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:20.660
to properly acquire the power of the
Tribe of Gold, which this planet possesses...

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:25.120
Let's jump, Erymanthos!

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:32.500
Instead of interfering with the past
and returning the present to nothingness...

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:46.760
We collect millions of pasts
from faraway time and space,

00:14:46.850 --> 00:14:51.980
and give over everything,
rights and wrongs alike, to the future.

00:14:53.610 --> 00:14:59.240
That was your and my true power, Erymanthos!

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:21.090
Just as I suspected, you're the key,

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:23.130
Belcross.

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:45.240
Dhianeila-sama?

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:50.410
The planet entrusted
Age and Belcross with it...

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:30.830
If Belcross is the key...

00:16:46.760 --> 00:16:49.970
Kervius is the door.

00:17:26.050 --> 00:17:27.930
Yuty...

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:12.320
This was the answer, Prome-sama.

00:19:12.410 --> 00:19:16.280
To open the door with our own hands.

00:19:29.670 --> 00:19:31.220
Age.

00:19:32.510 --> 00:19:42.440
Those Nodos... Age opened up what was
left to us on this planet with their own bodies.

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:47.980
They opened up the door to the other
universe where the Tribe of Gold left to...

00:20:16.220 --> 00:20:21.850
Far, far away, in a distant time.

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:27.310
In the outer space of
this universe there were

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:30.860
people who called
themselves "the Tribe of Gold."

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:10.820
They, who created planets and
had the power to foresee the future,

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:23.080
called out repeatedly to
the other still-primitive tribes.

00:21:24.960 --> 00:21:32.380
"Embark on a journey from the planets
you were born on, and out into a new world."

00:21:45.140 --> 00:21:49.730
"Embracing all the possibilities and hopes..."

00:22:06.580 --> 00:22:10.580
"Towards the future for each of you..."

00:22:20.010 --> 00:22:22.890
"Come forth."

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:33.440
Although I have known you for a long time

00:22:33.520 --> 00:22:40.820
I never dreamed these feelings would sprout

00:22:40.910 --> 00:22:45.990
And I would fall in love with you

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:56.750
Casually going home,
as I look at the stars in the night sky

00:22:56.840 --> 00:23:09.600
I take the long way on purpose
and lean on your shoulder as we walk

00:23:09.680 --> 00:23:20.820
You tell me you think we can overcome
anything as long as we stay together

00:23:20.900 --> 00:23:26.120
I think as I look into your forthright eyes

00:23:26.200 --> 00:23:32.710
That I love you

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:40.260
Believing in the day when we'll set out
on a journey together with many other tribes...

00:23:40.340 --> 00:23:44.590
Next time on Heroic Age,
the final episode: "Age."
